    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 182,
        "text": "Thanks for coming, everyone. This is the first meeting of the Green Street Garden Group. We have a small piece of land behind the library. We can use it, but we must decide how.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "babbad0ba3b67f1694bdddf1a343e7b5ed0d1cda93980e9b4d020c6f19c064c7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 188,
        "sourceEnd": 292,
        "text": "I think we should grow vegetables. If we grow vegetables, we can share them with families who need food.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "a38d1fac277d3f08e656cc16a16ea4a653e936306c950f929a48cafdfb0cb558",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 298,
        "sourceEnd": 409,
        "text": "That's a good idea. But we need water. The tap is far away. If we don't have enough water, the plants will die.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "4efad27fa585b87213ce213895cf2d9a594fffcba373e45d749ba9c05bcc1819",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 415,
        "sourceEnd": 501,
        "text": "True. Therefore, we should collect rain water. We can put a big barrel under the roof.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "1525dd9f952c475e32f9164f75aad12b77a1a742fde1e7e75850981fd8bb231e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 507,
        "sourceEnd": 566,
        "text": "Good. But a barrel costs money. We have only fifty dollars.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7a1cfbe10a910e5c9d7cf07feb352141aefe528d7c19ce2da7de87b52812e51c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 572,
        "sourceEnd": 654,
        "text": "Hmm. If we buy a barrel, we can't buy seeds. Maybe we can ask the school for help.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "ce0dde3d22aa2908cbf4b1973833cfb51c40114280af7b75e4e2a41bee3fe64b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 660,
        "sourceEnd": 760,
        "text": "Yes. Let's ask the school. Also, we need volunteers. If we have more volunteers, we can work faster.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "5d9da2a1bbf707372134ee5f262171980c6255ca49acb74127772bb429bec563",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 766,
        "sourceEnd": 854,
        "text": "I can ask my neighbors. But some people don't like gardens. They say gardens make noise.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "767f826706d6e342f89e43155a8abe940c8c3078ac96b2f6e37bc94017aac2f1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 860,
        "sourceEnd": 949,
        "text": "That's a problem. Therefore, we should talk to them first. We can invite them to join us.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "d0ad4ae9355d187897b4cb6d789de8b85a25688ef89c9a12a1bc75463e4d730b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 955,
        "sourceEnd": 1035,
        "text": "OK. And we should not use chemicals. If we use chemicals, the soil will get bad.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "45c75e44af30614582c1f6b1d7efde0c12775a0520762fb52885ba2c04abb918",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1041,
        "sourceEnd": 1114,
        "text": "Right. So we will use natural compost. It is cheap and good for the soil.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "b18e160ad8640539cb4db815ecc70e405d733e9bed88358b7c96a15de60e1f36",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1120,
        "sourceEnd": 1169,
        "text": "What about the tools? We need shovels and gloves.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "63f678f09705cc0ce35ca7c0b9edc2c570a3ea7a25d3970c5f4502e4704c3afc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1175,
        "sourceEnd": 1237,
        "text": "We can borrow tools from the community center. They have many.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "621bfa4e2b4cbe170a1f529dd502b313292d942caaf0d441cd27b2debd6051c0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1243,
        "sourceEnd": 1314,
        "text": "Great. So, if we get the barrel and the tools, we can start next month.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "dd175814a14a35c5d896b365c04d2805b277f7c27c438b5066743f66283f014b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1320,
        "sourceEnd": 1373,
        "text": "Yes. Let's meet again next week. Thank you, everyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "b870043b73c44a264e9b17ff8263cdf4ca08e9c1c1ced12b1d57e47764b9997b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
